{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量千川-工具\",\"巨量营销-智能投放与优化工具\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量千川\",\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"用户可以通过传入视频id和投放设置(setting)创建对应的前测任务。使用限制为同一客户1000素材/24H，低效检测能力已下线；授权access_token可通过【获取Access token】接口获取，返回码和返回信息详见【附录-返回码】。\",\"id\":\"diagnosis_task.adv.create\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/diagnosis_task/adv/create/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取Access token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix_return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"此接口返回码和信息需参考该附录文档\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"title\":\"Adv创建前测任务\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-aGh05yhh\">通过此接口，用户可以通过传入视频id和投放设置(setting)创建对应的前测任务</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-mnSnC8v4\">使用限制：</p><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-3lcdt179xqu000\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-En9Uaml3\">同一客户 1000素材/24H</li></ul><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2httl7rib00000\">⚠️ 低效检测能力已下线</p><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1799031155382330%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%22QvtQL%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Q8wxueQM\" id=\"h346b9f0-Q8wxueQM\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-OHdFZOcV\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/diagnosis_task/adv/create/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/diagnosis_task/adv/create/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1816971004339210\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-KJzctc0A\" id=\"h346b9f0-KJzctc0A\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-BdRytEAJ\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Sj0pgDqV\" id=\"h346b9f0-Sj0pgDqV\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-OuZ8PZBN\" id=\"h346b9f0-OuZ8PZBN\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><secti