ring</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-QRCGhpcF\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-fLO0EHuf\"><code>OCPC</code> ocpc</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-uQhwvuN2\"><code>CPA</code> cpa</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-miSQRFss\"><code>OCPM</code> ocpm</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">cost_cap</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\">是否最优成本出价，只有AD支持，千川场景下会忽略本字段</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">target_cost</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\">是否稳定成本出价，只有AD支持，千川场景下会忽略本字段</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">nobid</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\">是否最大转化出价，只有AD支持，千川场景下会忽略本字段</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">cpc_bid</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>double</p></section><section class=\"col description\">目标点击成本：取值范围: [1, 10000],  精确到小数点后2位</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">budget</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type